  <span class="text-olive-400 font-medium">electron</span>,
  <span class="text-olive-400 font-medium">react</span>
  & a
  <Tip word="concerning" class="font-hand text-amber-300 underline decoration-wavy decoration-amber-700 underline-offset-4">
    one to route, one to talk, one to judge the other two.
  </Tip>
  number of llms
</p>

<br>
 <p class="text-zinc-300">
  building
  <a href="https://iamthera.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-purple-400 font-bold underline decoration-green-700 hover:text-purple-300 transition-colors">thera.</a>
  – the ai companion that
  <span class="font-serif-it text-pink-400">does things</span>
</p>
<ul class="mt-4 pl-1 text-sm text-zinc-400 space-y-3">
  <li class="flex gap-3">
    <span class="text-purple-400">01</span>
    <span>
      <span class="text-zinc-200">lives on your mac</span> as a
      <Tip word="floating widget" class="text-purple-300 font-bold border-b border-dashed border-purple-500">
        asked her what was on my screen. got reviewed instead.
      </Tip>,
      <Tip word="reads the room" class="font-serif-it text-lime-300">
        the room being your screen. yes, she saw the 47 tabs.
      </Tip>
      &
      <Tip word="nudges" class="font-hand text-amber-300 underline decoration-wavy decoration-amber-700 underline-offset-4">
        <span class="text-amber-300">nudge</span> (n.) – a polite tap on the shoulder from software that has seen your screen time. actual example: "23 unread messages is a choice."
      </Tip>
      you
    </span>
  </li>
  <li class="flex gap-3">
    <span class="text-orange-400">02</span>
    <span>
      <Tip word="talks back" class="text-orange-300 font-bold italic border-b border-dashed border-orange-500">
        in both senses of the phrase.
      </Tip>
      in real time – <span class="text-zinc-200">voice in</span>, <span class="font-serif-it text-zinc-200">voice out</span>
    </span>
  </li>
  <li class="flex gap-3">
    <span class="text-green-500">03</span>
    <span>
      actually
      <Tip word="does the task" class="text-green-400 font-bold border-b border-dashed border-green-600">
        you say it, she drafts it, you hit send. calling in sick has never been this efficient.
      </Tip>:
      <span class="text-red-300">mail</span>, <span class="text-green-300">music</span>, <span class="text-amber-200">browser</span>, <span class="text-violet-300 italic">background research</span>
    </span>
  </li>
  <li class="flex gap-3">
    <span class="text-pink-400">04</span>
    <span>
      <Tip word="remembers" class="font-serif-it text-pink-400">
        like an elephant, but with a sqlite database. she still knows what you said in march.
      </Tip>
      you <span class="text-zinc-200 tracking-widest">across sessions</span>
    </span>
  </li>
</ul>

<br>
 <p class="text-zinc-500">
  <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest border border-zinc-700 rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 mr-1">ex</span>
  <span class="text-purple-400 line-through decoration-zinc-600">roset</span>
  – movie based

  <span class="relative inline-block group text-pink-400 cursor-pointer underline decoration-green-700">
    dating

    <span class="absolute left-0 top-7 w-55 p-4 bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-300 text-xs rounded-xl shadow-xl opacity-0 translate-y-2 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:translate-y-0 transition-all duration-200 pointer-events-none z-50">

      <span class="absolute left-4 -top-2 w-4 h-4 bg-zinc-800 rotate-45"></span>

      to be loved is to be known.
    </span>

  </span> app
</p>

<br>
  <p class="mb-10">
    i love <span class="relative inline-block group text-green-500 font-bold cursor-pointer underline decoration-green-700">
    films
    <span class="absolute left-0 top-7 w-55 p-4 bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-300 text-xs rounded-xl shadow-xl opacity-0 translate-y-2 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:translate-y-0 transition-all duration-200 pointer-events-none z-50">
      <span class="absolute left-4 -top-2 w-4 h-4 bg-zinc-800 rotate-45"></span>
      carpe diem.
    </span>
  </span> <span class="font-bold">& <span class="relative inline-block group text-red-500 font-bold cursor-pointer underline decoration-green-700">
    poetry
    <span class="absolute left-0 top-7 w-55 p-4 bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-300 text-xs rounded-xl shadow-xl opacity-0 translate-y-2 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:translate-y-0 transition-all duration-200 pointer-events-none z-50">
      <span class="absolute left-4 -top-2 w-4 h-4 bg-zinc-800 rotate-45"></span>
      Dear Milena, I wish the world were ending tomorrow. Then I could take the next train, arrive at your doorstep in Vienna, and say: “Come with me, Milena. We are going to love each other without scruples or fear or restraint. Because the world is ending tomorrow.”
    </span>
  </span> [what would this world be without <span class="text-bold text-pink-600">art?</span>]
  </p>

  <div class=" text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed">
	<p class="font-extrabold text-lg text-stone-200">gonna throw some of my fav quotes cause why not :</p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 divide-y-2 divide-dashed  text-zinc-400  text-sm">
		<li class=" py-4 relative inline-block group cursor-pointer">
			We don't read and write poetry because it's cute. We read and write poetry because we are members of the human race. And the human race is filled with passion. And medicine, law, business, engineering, these are noble pursuits and necessary to sustain life. But poetry, beauty, romance, love, these are what we stay alive for
			<span class="absolute left-0 top-full mt-2 w-64 p-4 bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-300 text-xs rounded-xl shadow-xl opacity-0 translate-y-2 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:translate-y-0 transition-all duration-200 pointer-events-none z-50">
				<span class="absolute left-4 -top-2 w-4 h-4 bg-zinc-800 rotate-45"></span>
				<p class="text-red-500">John Keating</p> <span class="text-pink-400">(Oh Captain! My Captain!)</span><p>Dead Poets Society [1989]</p>
			</span>
		</li>
		<li class=" py-4 relative inline-block group cursor-pointer">
			Art will give you crowns in heaven and laurels on Earth, but also, it will tear your heart out and leave you lonely. You'll be a shanda for your loved ones. An exile in the desert. A gypsy. Art is no game! Art is dangerous as a lion's mouth. It'll bite your head off
			<span class="absolute left-0 top-full mt-2 w-64 p-4 bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-300 text-xs rounded-xl shadow-xl opacity-0 translate-y-2 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:translate-y-0 transition-all duration-200 pointer-events-none z-50">
				<span class="absolute left-4 -top-2 w-4 h-4 bg-zinc-800 rotate-45"></span>
				 <p class="text-orange-300">Uncle Boris</p>The Fabelmans[2022]
			</span>
		</li>
		<li class="py-4 relative inline-block group cursor-pointer">
			Sometimes doing the right thing does feel terrible
			<span class="absolute left-0 top-full mt-2 w-64 p-4 bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-300 text-xs rounded-xl shadow-xl opacity-0 translate-y-2 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:translate-y-0 transition-all duration-200 pointer-events-none z-50">
				<span class="absolute left-4 -top-2 w-4 h-4 bg-zinc-800 rotate-45"></span>
				 <p class="text-yellow-300">Anna</p>Eternity [2025]
			</span>
		</li>
	</ul>

	
  </div>

  <p class="mt-8 text-zinc-500">
   aside from this, i also like travelling and to talk bout philosphy
  </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-8">
    <div class="h-40 bg-zinc-800 rounded-xl">
      <img
        id="gallery-img-1"
        src="/kidkavin.JPG"
        alt="description"
        class="w-full h-full object-cover rounded"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="h-40 bg-zinc-800 rounded-xl">
      <img
        id="gallery-img-2"
        src="/kunfayakun.jpeg"
        alt="description"
        class="w-full h-full object-cover rounded"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="h-40 bg-zinc-800 rounded-xl">
      <img
        id="gallery-img-3"
        src="/richmond.jpeg"
        alt="description"
        class="w-full h-full object-cover object-[5%_99%] rounded"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
  <br></br>
<div>
  <p id="rome-text" class="text-zinc-600 text-xs pt-2">
    rome wasnt build in a day cause they didnt have claude code
  </p>
</div>

<br>
<p class="mb-3 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-600">also made</p>
<div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
  <div class="border border-dashed border-zinc-700 rounded-xl p-4 hover:border-amber-400 transition-colors">
    <p class="flex items-baseline justify-between">
      <span class="font-serif-it text-amber-300">archetype</span>
      <span class="text-xs text-zinc-600">2025</span>
    </p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-400">
      your personality,
      <Tip word="judged" class="font-hand text-amber-300">
        jungian archetypes, generated from the films you picked. your letterboxd was always a cry for help.
      </Tip>
      by your movie taste
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 text-[10px] text-zinc-500">
      <span class="border border-zinc-800 rounded px-1.5 py-0.5">react native</span>
      <span class="border border-zinc-800 rounded px-1.5 py-0.5">supabase</span>
      <span class="border border-zinc-800 rounded px-1.5 py-0.5">claude</span>
      <span class="border border-zinc-800 rounded px-1.5 py-0.5">tmdb</span>
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="border border-dashed border-zinc-700 rounded-xl p-4 hover:border-rose-400 transition-colors">
    <p class="flex items-baseline justify-between">
      <span class="font-serif-it text-rose-300">fleabot</span>
      <span class="text-xs text-zinc-600">2025</span>
    </p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-400">
      a knowledge assistant with memory and an
      <Tip word="attitude" align="right" class="font-hand text-rose-300">
        10+ rewrites of the system prompt until she stopped sounding like customer support.
      </Tip>
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 text-[10px] text-zinc-500">
      <span class="border border-zinc-800 rounded px-1.5 py-0.5">react</span>
      <span class="border border-zinc-800 rounded px-1.5 py-0.5">gemini</span>
      <span class="border border-zinc-800 rounded px-1.5 py-0.5">mem0</span>
      <span class="border border-zinc-800 rounded px-1.5 py-0.5">drive + notion</span>
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
<br>
<p class="text-zinc-400">projects @<!-- --> <a href="https://github.com/Kavin-Kl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-zinc-300 hover:text-white transition-colors">github<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10" height="10" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="inline ml-0.5 opacity-50"><path d="M200,64V168a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V83.31L69.66,197.66a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L172.69,72H88a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H192A8,8,0,0,1,200,64Z"></path></svg></a></p>
<br>
<div class="flex items-center gap-6 text-zinc-400 text-sm">
  <a href="https://www.instagram.com/kavi1nnn/" class="hover:text-white transition">instagram</a>
  <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/kavin-kl-452829297/" class="hover:text-white transition">linkedin</a>
  <a href="mailto:kavinkl20@gmail.com" class="hover:text-white transition">email</a>
  <a href="https://boxd.it/50kjD" class="hover:text-white transition">films?</a>
</div>

<div class="mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-3">
  <input
    id="contact-message"
    type="text"
    placeholder="okay yappocino..."
    class="w-full sm:flex-1 px-3 py-2 rounded border border-zinc-700 bg-transparent text-sm outline-none focus:border-zinc-400"
  />
  <button
    id="contact-button"
    class="px-4 py-2 text-red-500 font-extrabold border border-red-500 rounded text-sm hover:bg-red-500 hover:text-black transition-colors"
  >
    contact me
  </button>
</div>
<p id="contact-feedback" class="mt-2 text-xs text-zinc-500"></p>

<script>
  const messageInput = document.getElementById("contact-message");
  const contactButton = document.getElementById("contact-button");
  const feedback = document.getElementById("contact-feedback");

  const keywords = ["misba"];

  contactButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {
    const value = messageInput?.value.trim();
    if (!value) {
      if (feedback) feedback.textContent = "type a message first.";
      return;
    }

    const lower = value.toLowerCase();
    const hasKeyword = keywords.some((k) => lower.includes(k));

    if (hasKeyword) {
      const nameEl = document.getElementById("hero-name");
      const subtitleEl = document.getElementById("hero-subtitle");
      const img1 = document.getElementById("gallery-img-1");
      const img2 = document.getElementById("gallery-img-2");
      const img3 = document.getElementById("gallery-img-3");
      const mainContent = document.getElementById("main-content");

      // play tt.mp3 when the special words are present
      try {
        // @ts-ignore
        let audio = window._ttAudio;
        if (!audio) {
          audio = new Audio("/tt.mp3");
          // @ts-ignore
          window._ttAudio = audio;
        }
        audio.currentTime = 0;
        audio.play().catch(() => {});
      } catch {}

      // scroll to top first
      window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: "smooth" });

      // slight delay so scroll starts, then animate + swap
      setTimeout(() => {
        if (nameEl) {
          nameEl.textContent = "misba aziz";
          nameEl.classList?.remove("hero-animate");
          // @ts-ignore
          void nameEl.offsetWidth;
          nameEl.classList?.add("hero-animate");
        }
        if (subtitleEl) {
          subtitleEl.textContent = "pallavaram baddie";
          // @ts-ignore
          subtitleEl.classList?.remove("hero-animate");
          // @ts-ignore
          void subtitleEl.offsetWidth;
          // @ts-ignore
          subtitleEl.classList?.add("hero-animate");
        }
        if (img1) img1.setAttribute("src", "/misba (1).jpeg");
        if (img2) img2.setAttribute("src", "/misba (2).jpeg");
        if (img3) img3.setAttribute("src", "/misba (3).jpeg");

        if (mainContent) {
          const lyrics =
            "Tum tak, tum tak, tum tak, sohne yaar\n" +
            "Tum tak, tum tak, tum tak, sohne yaar\n" +
            "Tum tak, tum tak, arzi meri, phir aage jo marzi\n" +
            "Tum tak, tum tak arzi meri, phir teri jo marzi\n" +
            "Meri har dushwaari bas tum tak";
          mainContent.textContent = lyrics;
          mainContent.classList?.add("whitespace-pre-line", "leading-relaxed");
        }

        const rome = document.getElementById("rome-text");
        if (rome) {
          rome.textContent =
            "rome wasnt build in a day nor was my love for her";
        }

        if (feedback) feedback.textContent = "message delivered.";
      }, 300);

      // do NOT open mail app when special words present
      return;
    }

    const params = new URLSearchParams({
      subject: "Portfolio contact",
      body: value,
    });
    window.location.href = `mailto:kavinkl20@gmail.com?${params.toString()}`;

    if (feedback) feedback.textContent = "opening your mail app...";
  });
</script>
</Layout>